      {"t":"fill","q":"__ ควาย","p":"the letter kh, as in buffalo","a":["ค","khaaw"],"o":["ข","ก","ง"],"why":"ควาย starts with the low-class ค, the kh letter used in ค ควาย.","xr":["khǎaw","gaaw","ngaaw"]},
      {"t":"type","p":"Type the romanization of ขา (leg)","a":["khǎa"],"hint":"kh · long aa · high class","x":["khaa"],"why":"ข is a high-class consonant: with a long vowel and no tone mark it gives a rising tone.","strict":true},
      {"t":"type","p":"Type the romanization of สวย (pretty)","a":["sǔuai"],"hint":"s · uuai · high class","x":["suuai"],"why":"ส is a high-class consonant, so สวย has a rising tone; said with a mid tone it is ซวย, unlucky.","strict":true},
      {"t":"type","p":"Type the romanization of the letter ข and its name word","a":["khǎaw khài"],"hint":"kh + aaw · then the word egg","x":["gài"],"why":"Its name is ข ไข่: kh plus aaw, then the word for egg.","strict":true}
