      {"t":"type","p":"look at the dog","a":["ดู หมา","duu mǎa"],"hint":"ดู (duu) · หมา (mǎa)","x":["ดุ"],"why":"ดู has a long vowel; ดุ, with a short vowel, means to scold.","xr":["dù"]},
      {"t":"type","p":"Type the romanization of เรือ (boat)","a":["ruuea"],"hint":"one vowel in three pieces: เ ื อ","x":["rao"],"why":"เรือ is one vowel, uuea, written around ร: เ before, ื above, อ after."}
